Description: operator-guided reconnaissance and penetration testing platform
 Legion imports or runs Nmap scans into a persistent project, correlates
 what it learns about each host in a local evidence graph, and runs
 follow-up tooling through a governed scheduler with approval gates and an
 audit log. It provides a web interface (the primary surface), a headless
 CLI for automation, an MCP server for AI agents, and a legacy Qt desktop UI.
